    "format": "html",
    "html": "Ed Masaki is a master pistolsmith from Hawaii.  If there was someone who would know the best methods for maintaining a fine accurized pistol, he is the man.<br><br>\n<div><center>\n<font face=\"Arial\"  size=5  color=\"green\">OIL THESE PLACES</font><br>\n\n<img src=\"ed-oiler.gif\" height=305 width=573 alt=\"Ed Masaki on Oiling the 1911\" border=0><br><br>\nWhen the numbered places look dry, oil them.\n\n</center></div>",
    "text": "Ed Masaki is a master pistolsmith from Hawaii. If there was someone who would know the best methods for maintaining a fine accurized pistol, he is the man.\nOIL THESE PLACES\nWhen the numbered places look dry, oil them."
